WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.625
Adding and subtracting are moves along the number line.

2
00:00:04.651 --> 00:00:09.426
Negative three plus five: start at negative three, and move right five.

3
00:00:10.306 --> 00:00:13.731
Subtracting goes the opposite way: left five.

4
00:00:15.733 --> 00:00:18.358
Now subtract negative two.

5
00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:33.283
Adding negative two goes left, so subtracting it goes right.
